/P0_BACKLOG_*.md
/docs/*-backlog.md
/docs/*-parity.md
/docs/*-research.md
/docs/research/
/docs/academy/provenance/private/
/scripts/*-probe.mjs
/scripts/*-repro.mjs
qa-audit-a3/
.dev.vars
.wrangler/

